<title>USA: Electronic Retailing names president.</title>
<headline>Electronic Retailing names president.</headline>
<dateline>WILTON, Conn. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronic Retailing Systems International Inc said Friday it appointed George Weathersby as president.</p>
<p>A member of the ERS Board since 1996, Weathersby also chairs its executive committee.  </p>
<p>A statement issued by Electronoic Retailing Systems did not say what Weathersby's previous employment was.</p>
<p>The statement said that Bruce Failing, who has served as company president since its inception in 1990, has assumed the title of vice chairman of the board and CEO.</p>
</text>
